msgid ""
"Take a 20-question exam to test your quantum chemistry skills and receive a "
"badge from the IBM Training website."
msgstr ""
"Passe un examen de 20 questions pour tester tes compétences en chimie "
"quantique et reçois un badge sur le site IBM Training."

